{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970610/extras/44f3cab47f358c454b83814af13373b3.avif?t=1760428062\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970610/extras_big/44f3cab47f358c454b83814af13373b3.webp?t=1760428062 width=1560 height=695 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Remnants of War, you play as a lone stranger trying to survive in a city overrun by chaos. At the start, choose one of six unique characters, from warriors to mages, each with their own abilities and playstyle. Explore the city and surrounding lands to find powerful items and equipment to upgrade your character. Among these are the legendary Remnants of War, banned artifacts from ancient conflicts, capable of changing the course of battle when used wisely. Discover hidden areas and uncover their secrets as you face a wide variety of enemies, from werewolves to ghosts, each with unique skills. By harnessing the power of Remnants, you can even temporarily take control of defeated foes to turn their abilities against others. Venture into dangerous lands filled with dragons, wizards, and other monstrous threats. Upgrade your skills, craft potions, and master your strategy to survive this land\u2019s ruthless challenges. Every encounter tests your reflexes, wit, and courage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970610?t=1760428062","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970610?t=1760428062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970610/13bbce02555288d59fde9a034e5e07042461dbf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760428062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970610/13bbce02555288d59fde9a034e5e07042461dbf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760428062","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3988090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970610/extras/44f3cab47f358c454b83814af13373b3.avif?t=1760428062\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970610/extras_big/44f3cab47f358c454b83814af13373b3.webp?t=1760428062 width=1560 height=695 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Remnants of War, you play as a lone stranger trying to survive in a city overrun by chaos. At the start, choose one of six unique characters, from warriors to mages, each with their own abilities and playstyle. Explore the city and surrounding lands to find powerful items and equipment to upgrade your character. Among these are the legendary Remnants of War, banned artifacts from ancient conflicts, capable of changing the course of battle when used wisely. Discover hidden areas and uncover their secrets as you face a wide variety of enemies, from werewolves to ghosts, each with unique skills. By harnessing the power of Remnants, you can even temporarily take control of defeated foes to turn their abilities against others. Venture into dangerous lands filled with dragons, wizards, and other monstrous threats. Upgrade your skills, craft potions, and master your strategy to survive this land\u2019s ruthless challenges. Every encounter tests your reflexes, wit, and courage.</p>","developers":["Akkoc Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st